inter=hero('Reference','Interview preparation','Natural scripts, 100 project-specific questions, weaknesses and mock practice. All claims are constrained by active root evidence.')+'<h2>30-second script</h2><div class="card">I built a binary classifier for next-month credit-card payment default using UCI client credit history. The active pipeline engineers 42 features, compares six models and saves CatBoost. Its verified 6,000-row holdout ROC-AUC is '+facts['ROC-AUC']+'; I discuss recall as well as accuracy because the data is imbalanced.</div><h2>90-second script</h2><div class="card">This is default prediction, not fraud. The data has 30,000 2005 Taiwan client records and 22.12% defaults. I drop ID, repair anomalous category codes, add utilisation/payment-ratio/delay/trend features, then impute, encode and scale. The trainer tunes six models; saved CatBoost has ROC-AUC '+facts['ROC-AUC']+', accuracy '+facts['accuracy']+', precision '+facts['precision']+' and recall '+facts['recall']+'. I openly state it is educational: test helped select the model, threshold/calibration/fairness/monitoring are not implemented.</div><h2>3–5 minute presentation flow</h2><ol><li>Problem: default not fraud.</li><li>Motivation: prioritisation, never automatic decision.</li><li>Data and EDA facts.</li><li>Features/preprocessing.</li><li>Imbalance.</li><li>Models/training.</li><li>Metrics/matrix.</li><li>Limitations/future work.</li></ol><h2>Question bank (100)</h2>'+''.join('<details><summary>'+c+': '+q+'</summary><p><b>What interviewer tests:</b> connection of technical idea to this repository.</p><p><b>Answer:</b> '+a+'</p><p><b>Follow-up:</b> What is your evidence?</p><p><b>Strong follow-up:</b> Cite active source, artifact inspection or recomputed metrics; never infer missing implementation.</p></details>' for c,q,a in questions)+'<h2>Questions exposing weaknesses</h2><table><tr><th>Issue</th><th>Honest response</th><th>Improve</th></tr><tr><td>Test selects winner</td><td>Yes; I would isolate final test evaluation.</td><td>Train-only stratified CV.</td></tr><tr><td>No SMOTE/weights</td><td>Not implemented.</td><td>Compare safely inside folds.</td></tr><tr><td>.5 threshold</td><td>Default cutoff; UI bands do not change it.</td><td>Cost/capacity/calibration study.</td></tr><tr><td>Historical sensitive data</td><td>Academic demo only.</td><td>Governance/fairness/current data.</td></tr></table><h2>Mock interview (20 turns)</h2>'+''.join('<div class="card"><b>Interviewer:</b> '+q+'<br><b>Candidate:</b> '+a+'<br><i>Follow-up:</i> Cite code/artifact evidence and name a limitation.</div>' for _,q,a in questions[:20])
